 || (isAdmin() && isProviderRole(get(/databases/$(database)/documents/users/$(uid)).data.role));\n        allow create: if validDemoSubscriptionHistoryCreate(uid, transactionId);\n        allow update, delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      match /notifications/{notificationId} {\n        allow get, list: if isDocumentOwner(uid);\n        allow create: if validCustomerNotificationCreate(uid, notificationId);\n        allow update: if (isDocumentOwner(uid)\n            && resource.data.customerId == uid\n            && resource.data.isRead == false\n            && request.resource.data.isRead == true\n            && request.resource.data.readAt == request.time\n            && request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\"isRead\", \"readAt\"]))\n          || validCustomerNotificationUpdate(uid, notificationId);\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      match /mechanicNotifications/{notificationId} {\n        allow get, list: if isDocumentOwner(uid);\n        allow create: if validMechanicNotificationCreate(uid, notificationId);\n        allow update: if (isDocumentOwner(uid)\n            && resource.data.providerId == uid\n            && resource.data.isRead == false\n            && request.resource.data.isRead == true\n            && request.resource.data.readAt == request.time\n            && request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\"isRead\", \"readAt\"]))\n          || validMechanicNotificationUpdate(uid, notificationId);\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      match /towingNotifications/{notificationId} {\n        allow get, list: if isDocumentOwner(uid);\n        allow create: if validTowingNotificationCreate(uid, notificationId);\n        allow update: if (isDocumentOwner(uid)\n            && resource.data.providerId == uid\n            && resource.data.isRead == false\n            && request.resource.data.isRead == true\n            && request.resource.data.readAt == request.time\n            && request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\"isRead\", \"readAt\"]))\n          || validTowingNotificationUpdate(uid, notificationId);\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      match /shopNotifications/{notificationId} {\n        allow get, list: if isDocumentOwner(uid);\n        allow create: if validShopNotificationCreate(uid, notificationId);\n        allow update: if (isDocumentOwner(uid)\n            && resource.data.providerId == uid\n            && resource.data.isRead == false\n            && request.resource.data.isRead == true\n            && request.resource.data.readAt == request.time\n            && request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\"isRead\", \"readAt\"]))\n          || validShopNotificationUpdate(uid, notificationId);\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      match /homeGarageNotifications/{notificationId} {\n        allow get, list: if isDocumentOwner(uid);\n        allow create: if validHomeGarageNotificationCreate(uid, notificationId);\n        allow update: if (isDocumentOwner(uid) && resource.data.providerId == uid\n            && resource.data.isRead == false && request.resource.data.isRead == true\n            && request.resource.data.readAt == request.time\n            && request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\"isRead\", \"readAt\"]))\n          || validHomeGarageNotificationUpdate(uid, notificationId);\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      // Account status messages are created by admins in the same batch as a\n      // provider status transition.\n      match /accountStatusNotifications/{notificationId} {\n        allow get, list: if isDocumentOwner(uid);\n        allow create: if request.resource.data.keys().hasOnly([\n            \"notificationId\", \"providerId\", \"providerRole\", \"status\", \"previousStatus\", \"title\", \"message\", \"reason\",\n            \"isRead\", \"readAt\", \"createdAt\", \"updatedAt\"\n          ])\n          && (validAdminVerificationNotification(uid, notificationId)\n            || validAdminAccountStatusNotification(uid, notificationId));\n        allow update: if isDocumentOwner(uid)\n          && resource.data.providerId == uid\n          && resource.data.isRead == false\n          && request.resource.data.isRead == true\n          && request.resource.data.readAt == request.time\n          && request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\"isRead\", \"readAt\"]);\n        allow update: if isAdmin()\n          && resource.data.providerId == uid\n          && resource.data.status == \"ACTIVE\"\n          && get(/databases/$(database)/documents/users/$(uid)).data.accountStatus == \"active\"\n          && get(/databases/$(database)/documents/users/$(uid)).data.accountStatusNotificationId == notificationId\n          && request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\"message\", \"updatedAt\"])\n          && request.resource.data.message is string\n          && request.resource.data.updatedAt == request.time;\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      // Per-shop idempotency pointer, private to the vehicle owner.\n      match /shopBookingLocks/{providerId} {\n        allow get: if isDocumentOwner(uid);\n        allow list: if false;\n        allow create, update: if validShopBookingLockWrite(uid, providerId);\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      match /homeGarageBookingLocks/{providerId} {\n        allow get: if isDocumentOwner(uid);\n        allow list: if false;\n        allow create, update: if validHomeGarageBookingLockWrite(uid, providerId);\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      // Providers may submit and resubmit private verification information,\n      // but cannot mark themselves as verified from the client application.\n      match /ownerProfile/profile {\n        allow get: if isDocumentOwner(uid) || isAdmin();\n        allow update: if validAdminReview(uid, \"owner\", false);\n        allow create, update: if isDocumentOwner(uid)\n          && request.resource.data.uid == uid\n          && request.resource.data.role == \"owner\"\n          && isPendingVerificationSubmission();\n        allow update: if isDocumentOwner(uid)\n          && request.resource.data.uid == resource.data.uid\n          && request.resource.data.role == resource.data.role\n          && request.resource.data.verificationStatus == resource.data.verificationStatus\n          && request.resource.data.identification == resource.data.identification\n          && request.resource.data.vehicleDocuments == resource.data.vehicleDocuments\n          && request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\"personal\", \"updatedAt\"])\n          && request.resource.data.personal.keys().hasOnly([\"fullName\", \"phone\", \"address\", \"cityMunicipality\"])\n          && request.resource.data.personal.fullName is string\n          && request.resource.data.personal.phone is string\n          && request.resource.data.personal.address is string\n          && request.resource.data.personal.cityMunicipality is string;\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      match /providerProfile/profile {\n        allow get: if isDocumentOwner(uid) || isAdmin();\n        allow list: if isAdmin() && resource.data.verificationStatus == \"PENDING\";\n        allow create: if isDocumentOwner(uid) && isPendingVerificationSubmission();\n        allow update: if validAdminReview(uid, \"onsite-mechanic\", false)\n          || (isDocumentOwner(uid) && isPendingVerificationSubmission())\n          || validMechanicProfileEdit(uid);\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      match /towingCompanyProfile/profile {\n        allow get: if isDocumentOwner(uid) || isAdmin();\n        allow list: if isAdmin() && resource.data.verificationStatus == \"PENDING\";\n        allow create: if isDocumentOwner(uid)\n          && request.resource.data.uid == uid\n          && request.resource.data.role == \"towing-company\"\n          && isPendingVerificationSubmission();\n        allow update: if (isDocumentOwner(uid)\n            && resource.data.uid == uid\n            && resource.data.role == \"towing-company\"\n            && resource.data.verificationStatus in [\"INCOMPLETE\", \"PENDING\", \"REJECTED\"]\n            && isPendingVerificationSubmission())\n          || validAdminReview(uid, \"towing-company\", false)\n          || validTowingCompanyProfileEdit(uid);\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      // Auto shops submit private verification documents here. Client writes\n      // are limited to a pending submission; approval remains administrator-controlled.\n      match /shopVerification/profile {\n        allow get: if isDocumentOwner(uid) || isAdmin();\n        allow update: if validAdminReview(uid, \"shop-owner\", false);\n        allow create: if isDocumentOwner(uid)\n          && request.resource.data.uid == uid\n          && request.resource.data.role == \"shop-owner\"\n          && request.resource.data.verificationStatus == \"PENDING\";\n        allow update: if isDocumentOwner(uid)\n            && request.resource.data.uid == uid\n            && request.resource.data.role == \"shop-owner\"\n            && request.resource.data.verificationStatus == \"PENDING\";\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      // HomeGarage parking providers submit private business documents here.\n      // Approval is performed by administration, never by the client.\n      match /homeGarageVerification/profile {\n        allow get: if isDocumentOwner(uid) || isAdmin();\n        allow create: if isDocumentOwner(uid)\n          && request.resource.data.uid == uid\n          && request.resource.data.role == \"homegarage\"\n          && request.resource.data.verificationStatus == \"PENDING\";\n        allow update: if validAdminReview(uid, \"homegarage\", false)\n          || (isDocumentOwner(uid)\n            && request.resource.data.uid == uid\n            && request.resource.data.role == \"homegarage\"\n            && request.resource.data.verificationStatus == \"PENDING\");\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n\n      match /towingPricing/{pricingId} {\n        allow get: if pricingId == \"config\" && (isDocumentOwner(uid)\n          || (signedIn()\n            && exists(/databases/$(database)/documents/providerListings/$(uid))\n            && get(/databases/$(database)/documents/providerListings/$(uid)).data.role == \"towing-company\"\n            && get(/databases/$(database)/documents/providerListings/$(uid)).data.visibility == \"active\"));\n        allow list: if false;\n        allow create: if pricingId == \"config\"\n          && isDocumentOwner(uid)\n          && verifiedTowingCompany(uid)\n          && validTowingPricingShape()\n          && request.resource.data.createdAt == request.time\n          && request.resource.data.updatedAt == request.time;\n        allow update: if pricingId == \"config\"\n          && isDocumentOwner(uid)\n          && verifiedTowingCompany(uid)\n          && validTowingPricingShape()\n          && request.resource.data.createdAt == resource.data.createdAt\n          && request.resource.data.updatedAt == request.time\n          && request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\n            \"basePrice\", \"pricePerKm\", \"pricingMode\", \"dispatcherPhone\", \"updatedAt\"\n          ]);\n        allow delete: if false;\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Business profiles stay private. Only trusted administration can approve a\n    // shop; clients cannot set approval, replace an approved doc or delete it.\n    match /providers/{uid} {\n      allow read: if isDocumentOwner(uid) || (isAdmin() && resource.data.role == \"shop-owner\");\n      allow list: if isAdmin() && resource.data.role == \"shop-owner\";\n      allow update: if validShopReview(uid);\n      allow create: if isDocumentOwner(uid)\n        && ((isShopOwner(uid)\n            && request.resource.data.uid == uid\n            && request.resource.data.role == \"shop-owner\"\n            && request.resource.data.verified == false\n            && request.resource.data.rating == 0\n            && request.resource.data.status == \"closed\")\n          || (!isShopOwner(uid) && request.resource.data.role != \"shop-owner\"));\n      allow update: if isDocumentOwner(uid)\n        && ((isShopOwner(uid) && resource.data.role == \"shop-owner\"\n            && request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([\n              \"businessName\", \"phone\", \"address\", \"latitude\", \"longitude\", \"status\"\n            ])\n            && request.resource.data.status in [\"open\", \"closed\"])\n          || (isShopOwner(uid) && resource.data.role == \"shop-owner\"\n            && validApprovedShopProfileSync(uid))\n          || (!isShopOwner(uid) && resource.data.role != \"shop-owner\" && request.resource.data.role != \"shop-owner\"));\n      allow delete: if isDocumentOwner(uid) && !isShopOwner(uid) && resource.data.role != \"shop-owner\";\n    }\n\n    // Providers publish the minimal customer-map document directly. If a\n    // provider's verification is later revoked, the trusted admin workflow\n    // must remove or deactivate this existing listing.\n    function isGuestReadablePhoneFreeListing() {\n      return resource.data.get(\"contactPhone\", \"\") == \"\"\n        && resource.data.visibility == \"active\"\n        && (resource.data.availability == \"available\" || resource.data.get(\"acceptsScheduledBookings\", false) == true);\n    }\n\n    // This collection is an ID-only index. Entries are created once alongside\n    // a valid public listing and remain stable across availability and admin\n    // hide/restore operations. Listing reads still pass the rule below.\n    match /publicProviderDirectory/{providerId} {\n      allow get, list: if true;\n      allow create: if isDocumentOwner(providerId)\n        && request.resource.data.keys().size() == 0\n        && accountIsActive(providerId)\n        && existsAfter(/databases/$(database)/documents/providerListings/$(providerId))\n        && getAfter(/databases/$(database)/documents/providerListings/$(providerId)).data.providerId == providerId\n        && getAfter(/databases/$(database)/documents/providerListings/$(providerId)).data.visibility == \"active\"\n        && getAfter(/databases/$(database)/documents/providerListings/$(providerId)).data.get(\"contactPhone\", \"\") == \"\"\n        && (getAfter(/databases/$(database)/documents/providerListings/$(providerId)).data.availability == \"available\"\n          || getAfter(/databases/$(database)/documents/providerListings/$(providerId)).data.get(\"acceptsScheduledBookings\", false) == true);\n      allow update, delete: if false;\n    }\n\n    match /providerListings/{providerId} {\n      allow get: if isAdmin() || isDocumentOwner(providerId) || (signedIn() && resource.data.visibility == \"active\" && (resource.data.availability == \"available\" || resource.data.get(\"acceptsScheduledBookings\", false) == true)) || isGuestReadablePhoneFreeListing();\n      // Guest collection reads stay disabled until the empty-marker list grant\n      // has passed the separate safety review and rollout gate.\n      allow list: if isAdmin() || (signedIn() && resource.data.visibility == \"active\" && (resource.data.availability == \"available\" || resource.data.get(\"acceptsScheduledBookings\", false) == true));\n      allow create: if accountIsActive(providerId) && validPublicListingCreate(providerId);\n      allow update: if isAdmin()\n        ? ((!request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasAny([\"contactPhone\"]) || request.resource.data.get(\"contactPhone\", \"\") == \"\")\n          && (request.resource.data.visibility == \"active\"\n          ? validAdminListingRestore(providerId)\n          : validAdminListingHide(providerId)))\n        : validProviderListingUpdate(providerId);\n      allow